#!/usr/bin/env python3
# =============================================================================
# nuxel-mfc-diag — safe Exynos 9820 MFC inventory / status / opt-in probe
#
# PWNAGE-61000.  Default mode is INVENTORY and it never opens /dev/video*.
#
# The historical failure was open(), not readdir(): the vendor MFC driver loads
# mfc_fw.bin from its .open() callback.  With the old request_firmware() path
# and CONFIG_FW_LOADER_USER_HELPER_FALLBACK=y, a missing blob waited for the
# 60 s firmware timeout and callers could enter uninterruptible D state.
#
# This tool therefore:
#   * resolves the decoder by exact sysfs identity (name/driver/compatible/ip_ver),
#     never by scanning and opening /dev/videoN;
#   * refuses any active open unless --device, --allow-hardware-open and a
#     matching owner-approved safety receipt are all present;
#   * never runs from package scripts, boot, login, plugin scanning or Settings;
#   * keeps the software fallback as the default.
#
# Schema: nuxel.mfc.status/1
# =============================================================================
